{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"mpsc-sender-closed-with-permit-held-body-end-001","description":"t.p reserves a slot, closes its sender and ends with the permit still held. The body's end drops the permit first (an unsent SendPermit aborts, reason Cancel, mpsc.rs:1663) and then the sender, so the parked recv of t.r completes with ASX_E_DISCONNECTED only then, after t.p's last step and not at the close.","unit":"mpsc","rules":["rule.obligation.reserve","rule.obligation.abort","inv.determinism.replayable"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":1000},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[{"name":"ch.q","type":"mpsc","capacity":2,"sender":"t.p","receiver":"t.r"}],"sync":[],"tasks":[{"name":"t.p","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"reserve_send","channel":"ch.q","as":"p.1"},{"op":"close_sender","channel":"ch.q"},{"op":"sleep","ns":100},{"op":"trace","message":"p ends holding the permit"}]},{"name":"t.r","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"recv","channel":"ch.q"},{"op":"trace","message":"r saw the close"}]}],"script":[],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
